    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To guarantee the quality of service expected while optimizing costs, we can focus on delivering high-value services such as AI engineering, project management, and business analysis, which are essential to the project success." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By carefully managing we resources, negotiating rates with subcontractors if necessary, and maintaining a lean project structure, we can ensure that our proposed solution meets the client's requirements while remaining financially sustainable for our company." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects a solution that assists agents in agents daily missions, facilitates access to information, improves answer quality, and reduces processing times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components and innovation strategy can we propose to meet these requirements, considering we experience with LLMs, RAG capabilities, and fine-tuning methods?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet The client requirements, we can propose an AI-powered solution that leverages we expertise in Large Language Models (LLMs), Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities, and fine-tuning methods. we preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, can be used as the foundation for this solution.  we can utilize RAG capabilities to facilitate access to information by implementing a retrieval strategy that provides relevant information from internal procedures, regulatory texts, and internal documents. we experience with vector stores such as Qdrant, Weaviate, pgvector, and FAISS can help in efficient storage and retrieval of relevant information from internal procedures, regulatory texts, and internal documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To improve answer quality, we can fine-tune Our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct using we preferred fine-tuning methods, including LoRA, QLoRA, or full fine-tuning on a domain-specific corpus. fine-tune will enable Our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct to adapt to the administrative context and provide more accurate responses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we RAG capabilities can assist in the instruction of files by providing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications to carry out. we can also leverage we experience with explainability methods such as source citation, chain-of-thought display, SHAP, and LIME to provide transparent and explicable recommendations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of innovation strategy, we can propose a phased approach, starting with a pilot phase on a limited scope, followed by progressive generalization to the entirety of the services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This will allow we to test and refine we solution while ensuring minimal disruption to the existing workflows. we typical v1 to v2 development cycle is around 9 months, which aligns with the client's expected project duration." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging we existing capabilities and expertise, we can deliver a high-quality AI-powered solution that meets the client's requirements and constraints, including regulatory compliance, data protection, and environmental sustainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client wishes to limit the environmental footprint of The client systems of information, proposing a solution that contributes to reducing energetic consumption and relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we ensure that a solution that contributes to reducing energetic consumption and relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact meets these environmental constraints, considering we current sustainability practices and experience with green hosting partners? we can ensure a solution that contributes to reducing energetic consumption and relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact meets The client environmental constraints by leveraging we existing sustainability practices and experience with green hosting partners. we has a track record of reducing energetic consumption, with a typical energy reduction of 35% versus baseline. we also have a carbon reporting capability based on GRI Standards, which will enable we to monitor and report the carbon footprint of a solution that contributes to reducing energetic consumption and relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, we have partnerships with green hosting providers such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, both of which use 100% renewable energy and have ISO14001 certification." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By hosting a solution that contributes to reducing energetic consumption and relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact on one of green hosting providers such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, both of which use 100% renewable energy and have ISO14001 certification infrastructure, we can minimize the carbon impact of the system." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we digital sobriety practices, including model quantization, auto-scaling, and query result caching, will help reduce energy consumption. we can propose a solution that incorporates our digital sobriety practices, including model quantization, auto-scaling, and query result caching to contribute to reducing the client's environmental footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

